245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Believe me, it is difficult to remember a dozen new names and faces. More often than not, we overthink while trying to be the best version of ourselves. As a girl freshly out of varsity, I remember worrying about everything.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Was I smiling too much? Laughing too loudly? What kind of personality was I projecting? Were my clothes too revealing? Was I wearing too much makeup - or none at all? And, of course, whether I actually deserved my job and salary.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Now that more than a year has elapsed, and I have finally settled in; I can reassure you that none of the above truly matters. Other things soon take priority - like studying and meeting deadlines. You will realise that everyone is in the same boat \(as one of my colleagues likes to say\). You will eventually fit in, find your circle, and sit your first exams \(and hopefully pass them too\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
