/E (Women are entering the actuarial profession in record numbers, making up nearly half of university students in some regions - a clear sign that the odds are shifting. However, this progress does not translate proportionally into seniority. Representation falls to around 35% across members and below 30% at Fellow level, with even fewer women in senior leadership roles.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [26]
>>
