<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (At the same time, sustainability risks are moving from the margins of corporate reporting to the centre of financial decision-making. With the growing adoption of sustainability disclosure standards such as IFRS S1 and IFRS S2, climate exposure is increasingly treated as a financial liability rather than a reputational concern.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
