367 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (She is quick to acknowledge the support system behind her, particularly the two nannies who have been with her family for over thirty years. But she is equally clear about the sacrifices: her social life stepped back. What she did not sacrifice was presence. She did not miss a single milestone in her daughters' lives. She brought them along on international trips whenever she could - something she believes seeded their love of travel. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [16]
>>
