/E (We ask about the future of the profession. There is genuine excitement in her voice. Climate risks. Geopolitical uncertainty. The Blue Economy. New, uncharted territories are multiplying. "These are opportunities," she says. And while artificial intelligence is transforming every corner of the field, she is categorical: "AI will not replace actuaries.")
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [8]
