/P 98 0 R
/T (As an 18-year-old girl with a self-proclaimed love for numbers, the word actuary felt like a gateway to doing something I would cherish for the rest of my life. What I did not realise then was that its meaning would stretch far beyond numbers in the years that followed. My journey has been quietly reshaped by the people I met along the way - and those who continue to walk alongside me today. I have come to understand that the true value of being an actuary rests on the backbone of its community.)
/E (As an 18-year-old girl with a self-proclaimed love for numbers, the word actuary felt like a gateway to doing something I would cherish for the rest of my life. What I did not realise then was that its meaning would stretch far beyond numbers in the years that followed. My journey has been quietly reshaped by the people I met along the way - and those who continue to walk alongside me today. I have come to understand that the true value of being an actuary rests on the backbone of its community.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
